{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "dc233097-811b-8ab4-a190-adf1598fc26a",
  "created_at": "2025-12-29T12:08:27-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Barbara Burdick",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Kevin Sousa",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:05:17-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Kevin. Happy Monday, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:05:23-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, so the cold patch they put down last week, it's already washed out. All the gravel is just sitting in the road again and the hole's back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:05:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, gotcha. Which street are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, sorry. It's 24 Kay Street, right in front of the house. Up on the Hill."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:05:48-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Kay Street, 24. Got it. And that's the pothole that was patched last week, so this is a repeat at the same spot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, same spot exactly. And it's right in the bike lane, which is the part that bugs me. Somebody on a bike is going to hit that edge."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:06:12-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right in the bike lane, okay, I'm writing that down. That makes it more of a hazard, so I'll flag it. [pause] Is the hole deep, would you say? Like a couple inches, or bigger than that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:06:29-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Maybe three, four inches at the deepest. About the size of a dinner plate, a little bigger. The patch material is scattered down the street a bit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:06:42-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Three, four inches, dinner plate size, loose material scattered. That's plenty for me to put on the work order."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:06:51-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Um, do you know how long repairs usually take? Like once it's reported, are we talking days, weeks?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:00-05:00",
      "duration": 22,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Usually a few days to a week or so for something like this, depending on what else is ahead of it. Winter's tricky because cold patch is the temporary stuff and it doesn't always hold when it's wet and freezing. A lasting fix tends to wait for warmer weather."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, that makes sense. I figured it was something like that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:28-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do you want a callback number on the order, in case the crew needs to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:36-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. It's 401-555-0180."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-eight-zero. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barbara Burdick. B-U-R-D-I-C-K."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:44-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Barbara Burdick, got it. So, to read it back: 24 Kay Street, cold patch washed out in the bike lane, about four inches deep, gravel in the road. Anything I missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:07:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Honestly, this call is the highlight of my afternoon, so thanks for making it easy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:08:07-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, glad to help. I'll get this over to the crew supervisor today. If it gets worse before they get out there, give us a call back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:08:20-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. Thanks, Kevin."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-29T12:08:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet, Barbara. Have a good one."
    }
  ],
